{
  "id": 8834730787015,
  "title": "Winter Cardinal on Berry Branch Patchwork Christmas Quilt",
  "handle": "winter-cardinal-on-berry-branch-patchwork-christmas-quilt-43ecda62b6-43ecda62b6",
  "body_html": "<p>Add a cozy touch of winter beauty to your home with this beautiful custom quilt by Jeminise. Featuring a lovely watercolor illustration of a cardinal perched on a berry branch, this bedding piece brings the warmth and charm of nature indoors. Perfect for the holiday season or year-round comfort, it can also be customized with your own text or name, making it a truly thoughtful gift for your loved ones or a special addition to your guest bedroom.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt with your own text or name for a unique, personal touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Winter Cardinal Artwork:</strong> Features a realistic watercolor illustration of a cardinal on a berry branch with leaves, berries, and snow.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfortable:</strong> Made with a breathable polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for consecutive warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect as a bed quilt, throw blanket, picnic mat, or cozy companion for camping and outdoor trips.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and quick-drying to keep it fluffy and clean.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Pillowcases:</strong> Complete your bedding set by choosing to add matching custom pillowcases.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Red Bird-13</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cardinal Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (102x91 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
